            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Функция</td><td>Производная</td></tr><tr><td>s=t^n</td><td>$ \\frac{ds}{dt}=nt^n-1 $</td></tr><tr><td>s=cu</td><td>$ \\frac{ds}{dt}=c\\frac{du}{dt} $</td></tr><tr><td>s=u+v+w+...</td><td>$ \\frac{ds}{dt}=\\frac{du}{dt}+\\frac{dv}{dt}+\\frac{dw}{dt}+\\ldots $</td></tr><tr><td>s=c</td><td>$ \\frac{ds}{dt}=0 $</td></tr><tr><td>s=u^a v^b w^c ...</td><td>$ \\frac{ds}{dt}=s\\left(\\frac{a}{u}\\frac{du}{dt}+\\frac{b}{v}\\frac{dv}{dt}+\\frac{c}{w}\\frac{dw}{dt}+\\ldots\\right) $</td></tr></table>",
